 "title": "The Plant With Eternal Leaves",
 "cat": "biology",
 "emoji": "🌿",
 "sentences": [
  "This plant grows leaves that last 13 years.",
  "That is the longest lifespan recorded for any flowering plant's leaf.",
  "Banksia petiolaris is a rare prostrate shrub native to Western Australia.",
  "It features horizontal stems with thick, leathery upright leaves.",
  "In spring, it produces yellow cylindrical flower spikes up to 16 cm high.",
  "These flowers rely on insects like bees and ants for pollination.",
  "After bushfires, it regenerates solely through seeds."
